  "cover_text": "A fairly cold last half of January meant that I was in select on points—eyes were banded out, cold CMO.\nI managed to scrape my best performance of the year for the order. I put a bus stop to blackmail on which the gears were heavy but the confidence win equation was there for a reason. The pack wasn’t particularly hungry, so a win didn’t really start to feel like a win.\nHopefully, I will be steered in a slightly broader direction.Interahamadmin is still in charge, but that’s as close as we’ve seen",
